sequenceDiagram
    participant D as Doctor (Client)
    participant P as Patient (Client)
    participant E as Express Server (Socket)
    participant G as Gemini API
    participant M as MongoDB
    
    D->>E: Start Teleconsultation (WebRTC signaling)
    P->>E: Join Teleconsultation
    D->>E: Stream Audio (Scribe active)
    E->>E: Transcribe Audio Chunk
    D->>E: End Consultation
    E->>G: Send transcript for Medical Structuring
    G-->>E: Returns JSON Structured Prescription
    E->>M: Save Prescription
    E-->>D: Emit 'prescription_ready' with payload
    D->>D: Review & Confirm Prescription
